The Mouth of The River~
The smell of ocean salt is strong here. The ocean lies to the west and
the Black Market Wharves lay to the south. Those who wish to adventure 
at sea should be careful.  On the ocean lies a huge sea monster and a 
giant whirlpool which have caused hundreds of weary sailors to simply 
vanish.
