#3214
On the River.~
The river's current gains speed as it leaves Samsera's protection.
Rocks are scattered about the river, creating small rapids you
do not want to be caught in with a small canoe.  The tree line
to the north and south thickens and just ahead to the west they
form quite a large forest.  To the east, Samsera's skyline stands
out creating an overwelming feeling of security.
~
